WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.320
Speaker 1: It is indeed the last full day before&nbsp;
the 2022 midterm elections. And what a day it is,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:12.000
a truly packed program and we are going to be&nbsp;
talking about in significant detail tomorrow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.920
really what is at stake in this election.&nbsp;
But for today, we are going to contextualize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:21.960
it will contextualize it by looking at some of&nbsp;
the final Democratic and Republican rallies and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.460
some of the final polling as well. And one bit of&nbsp;
polling that came out over the last couple of days&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:32.700
that is particularly disturbing is the degree to&nbsp;
which this country, the United States, has fallen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:40.020
into a veritable cesspool of conspiratorial&nbsp;
thinking when you really don't need to find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:45.180
such conspiracies to understand what it is that is&nbsp;
going on in the country. And as is often the case,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:54.540
conspiracy theories have some kernel of truth&nbsp;
in their origin, but take people very much in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.540 --> 00:01:00.060
the wrong direction in terms of their beliefs. And&nbsp;
let me make it very concrete for you. A new poll&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:08.220
shows that 44% of voters see a secret cabal&nbsp;
that is controlling the federal government.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:15.180
When you look at this poll of 1000 registered&nbsp;
voters conducted at the very end of October, you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:22.560
see that 44% overall. But it's not that dramatic&nbsp;
a difference between Republicans and Democrats.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:30.420
53% of Republicans, 41% of independents and 37%&nbsp;
of Democrats believe the federal government is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:39.180
controlled by a secret cabal. The thing about&nbsp;
this is you don't need a conspiracy theory about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:48.060
a secret cabal. We know that overwhelmingly&nbsp;
government and industry and regulators and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:56.280
the world of finance are controlled by those very&nbsp;
corporations and the wealthy individuals that run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:03.180
those corporations. That's it. It's not a secret&nbsp;
cabal. There's no secret here. Okay. These are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:09.960
folks who have run things overwhelmingly in the&nbsp;
United States for over 100 years. You could argue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:17.220
you know, maybe there was a brief period in&nbsp;
the thirties and forties during FDR when it was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:22.800
really the government was kind of governing the&nbsp;
wealthy to a certain degree and not even really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:31.440
completely. The seeking the conspiracy to control&nbsp;
secretly is what is disturbing in particular here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:37.320
because you don't actually need to look very hard&nbsp;
for who's really in charge. There was I believe it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:44.340
was a Princeton study, and we covered it years&nbsp;
ago, which found the legislative desires of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:51.480
corporations and of the rich are much more likely&nbsp;
to be made into law than the legislative desires&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:59.160
of the average person. So we knew this already.&nbsp;
It's not a secret. It's out in the open. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:06.600
where it gets dangerous is that you have myriad&nbsp;
propaganda outlets and politicians and others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:15.120
who will take the kernel of truth, which&nbsp;
is there are entities and individuals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:22.920
Beyond just the average people. Whose desires&nbsp;
are overwhelmingly refracted, reflected in how&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:28.980
the country is run. That's true. And then that's&nbsp;
where you get into shadow government conspiracy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:34.560
theories. And we've seen every version of this&nbsp;
right now. It's kind of hot with the Republicans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:40.560
And Trump has been mentioning at rallies, it's&nbsp;
the Marxists, the socialists and the communists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:44.340
He doesn't know what any of those terms mean.&nbsp;
Doesn't know the differences between those two,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:49.200
those three terms. But he uses them. That's who is&nbsp;
secretly controlling everything. And then if you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.880
think about it clearly, you go and you look and&nbsp;
say, okay, if communists are controlling the U.S.,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:59.520
first thing we should do is find communists. And&nbsp;
then you go and you don't find any there's no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:04.140
communists in positions of power in the United&nbsp;
States, so you can very quickly debunk it. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:08.940
that's what they're going to. And then you know&nbsp;
the other ones, right? The Trilateral Commission,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:16.380
the Build the Birds, the Illuminati, the Q stuff.&nbsp;
And that theory about it's part of it's Democratic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:22.440
pedophiles who are controlling the country. It's&nbsp;
the Jews. That's a classic, as always. So what's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:32.340
so disturbing about some of this polling is that.&nbsp;
It is true. That not everyone's desires count&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:39.420
equally. Right? Your desires and my desires for&nbsp;
what we would like the law to be don't count as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:45.300
much as the desires of Apple as brought to&nbsp;
the government by highly priced lobbyists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:52.920
That's true. But the secret cabal, which lends&nbsp;
itself to all sorts of xenophobia and racism&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:59.340
and conspiracy theories. You don't need it. It's&nbsp;
all out in the open. And of course, we know that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:04.620
when you believe in the subterfuge, when you&nbsp;
believe in the conspiracy theory aspect of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:11.100
you often vote in ways that don't really make&nbsp;
any sense because you believe things that simply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:16.860
are not true. So anyway, that's context to some&nbsp;
degree for how people will be voting tomorrow.

